      <p className="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed m-0"><strong>No.</strong> IRCC has paused new commitment certificates for the Start-Up Visa program. Only entrepreneurs holding a valid Commitment Certificate issued <strong>before the pause deadline</strong> can proceed with their Permanent Residence applications. New applicants must pivot to PNP Entrepreneur streams or the C11 Work Permit.</p>
